WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.002
Before anyone joins a Popkin, they find it. Here is the front door.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.316
A visitor opens the landing page and reads: Your people, popped up in seconds. One

00:00:13.316 --> 00:00:16.923
button, Start a Popkin. Free. Takes about a minute.

00:00:17.123 --> 00:00:22.244
With it, a preview of a Popkin: Lakeside Weekend, fourteen here, wraps up Sunday.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.168
Scan. Join. You're in. Three steps: Pop one up. Share the QR code. You're together.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.840
Then four ideas, for every group that forms around a table.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.046
A Small group that keeps going. A Hackathon, for one weekend. A Team, for one

00:00:43.046 --> 00:00:45.686
season. A Family trip, for ten days.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.167
Better than a group chat. Five rows say why: joining, photos, plans, video, and the

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:53.716
end.

00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:56.955
Muted forever, or a proper send-off and recap.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.415
Free. Like, actually free. No ads, no premium tier.

00:01:03.615 --> 00:01:05.107
And under it, the footer.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.939
In the navigation, How it works and Ideas jump to their sections, and focus moves to

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:13.945
the heading.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.732
On a phone, the navigation keeps Start a Popkin. Sign in is in the footer.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.658
Start a Popkin opens sign-up. Sign in opens sign-in.

00:01:27.858 --> 00:01:32.302
And a person who is already signed in skips the page: they get My Popkins.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.939
Then the welcome screen. The same promise, and three ways on: Start a Popkin, Join

00:01:40.939 --> 00:01:44.311
with a code, and: Already have an account? Sign in.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.826
On a phone, the landing page is one column.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.051
From ten twenty-four pixels, the hero sits beside its preview, and the four ideas

00:01:57.051 --> 00:01:58.037
run across.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.255
And from seven sixty-eight, the welcome screen is split.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.808
What no screen shows: the page loads nothing from anywhere but Popkin, and its links

00:02:10.808 --> 00:02:12.424
work from the keyboard.

00:02:12.624 --> 00:02:17.334
Still to come: the Join with a code screen, and Safety, Privacy and Help.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.566
That is journey ten. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
